- Notes: Introduced `EyalEspressoRequirements and Design.docx` as the primary requirements/design artifact and linked it from `README.md`. This remains a `Z` increment because it is a project-documentation addition rather than a major architecture or feature-scope change.\par
- Resolved Defects:\par
  - None in this release.\par
